      "start_line": 1,
      "end_line": 1,
      "raw": "# Source header package consumers\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Source header package consumers"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000002",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 2,
      "end_line": 2,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 6,
      "raw": "This C++23 project consumes the installed public targets of every package in\nthe source-header migration fixture. Each public header is compiled in its own\ntranslation unit. No source directory is added to a consumer's include path.\nAn executable per package also checks that its runtime dependencies load.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 7,
      "end_line": 7,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 8,
      "end_line": 12,
      "raw": "Configure with `cmake -S tests/SourceHeaderConsumers -B tests/SourceHeaderConsumers/build`\nfrom the SDK directory, providing staged package prefixes in `CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH`.\nSet `HEADER_STAGE_ROOT` to require package discovery below that staging root.\nThen build and run CTest in that `build/` directory. Native source-only adapters\nare covered separately by `tests/NativeHeaderLayout`.\n"
    }
  ],
